1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,822
The threshold is neither inside

2
00:00:01,822 --> 00:00:03,644
nor outside—a boundary where spirits

3
00:00:03,644 --> 00:00:05,466
dwell. Never shake hands or

4
00:00:05,466 --> 00:00:07,288
pass objects across it, or

5
00:00:07,288 --> 00:00:09,109
discord follows. Step fully inside

6
00:00:09,109 --> 00:00:10,932
or outside first. Deals made

7
00:00:10,932 --> 00:00:12,754
across thresholds fail. Friendships fracture.

8
00:00:12,754 --> 00:00:14,576
The house spirits keep score,

9
00:00:14,576 --> 00:00:16,397
and the debt is paid

10
00:00:16,397 --> 00:00:18,219
in broken trust.
